    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mech Builder 3D</strong> \u2014 your perfect escape into the Gunpla-inspired world of model building. Experience the relaxing process of building a model kit with complete freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly assemble, paint, and pose all your models. Build mechs, monsters, armors, and so much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building all the kits will take around 7-9 hours of your time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diorama mode has endless repeatability, where you can display your models or recreate any iconic scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 3D models and pieces have been carefully crafted for a relaxing experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 model kits to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pressure-free experience: build your way, at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pose the models kits in any position you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock diorama mode to make your own mini-worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add effects like explosions, particles, and more to bring your dioramas to life.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mech Builder 3D</strong> \u2014 your perfect escape into the Gunpla-inspired world of model building. Experience the relaxing process of building a model kit with complete freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly assemble, paint, and pose all your models. Build mechs, monsters, armors, and so much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building all the kits will take around 7-9 hours of your time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diorama mode has endless repeatability, where you can display your models or recreate any iconic scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 3D models and pieces have been carefully crafted for a relaxing experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 model kits to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pressure-free experience: build your way, at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pose the models kits in any position you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock diorama mode to make your own mini-worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add effects like explosions, particles, and more to bring your dioramas to life.</p></li></ul>",
